# Files/paths the doc generator skips (read by scripts/docs/create-docs.R).
# One pattern per line. A trailing "/" means "any path containing this folder".

# Dead code kept only until deletion. It still names removed interfaces
# (e.g. IAnalysis, IDesignerImportService), so documenting it would point the
# reference site at interfaces that no longer exist. Never build docs from it.
stale/
